{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_otter_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_otter_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "造物之心",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_otter_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "446c032828d59d3af38ed8790371a21fb853c0969f871616c624f14c3ff92ebf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島本艦\n“魯特拉工作室”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "要睜大眼睛看好哦，可露希爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER，請從操作台上挑出M-11型源石隔離漆層。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "（上面的抗源石塗料起碼有十幾種，去掉了包裝，外形和質地都差不多。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "完全正確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這只是基本能力啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "這套熱能感應裝置裡有個組件壞了，咪波SUPER，請在三分鐘內修復它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "已經修復完畢。另外，還檢測到有個電子元件附在了基座下面，會影響熱能感應的效率，現已取出，裝置可以正常使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "真棒！才花了兩分鐘不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哇！它會說話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "智慧版本當然要加裝語音模組嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "它剛開口的時候，我也很不適應就是了。不過它即使能說話，好像也不怎麼愛說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "為什麼是這種粗粗的聲線......算了不重要，我和梅爾的審美差距很大哦嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "繼續繼續。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER，請重新設置工作室的門禁密碼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "已經重置，新密碼採用了大小寫字母、生僻符號、數字等共計五種字符的組合。對了，數字並不是你的生日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗚哇，真厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我宣佈，應用試驗第一階段，成功！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "怎麼樣，咪波全新智慧版本的原型機——咪波SUPER，表現如何？是不是比你的人工智慧小車要厲害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "真是聰明的小子！可是，剛剛這些，Lancet-2和Castle-3它們也能做到哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "啊啊啊鬆口鬆口，怎麼跟梅爾一樣咬人呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER，先放過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "性能表現是否超過小車尚待評估，但確實比它們要記仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "別過來，不許咬了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "梅爾，這次咪波SUPER升級，你花了多長時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗯，我看看日程表......已經三個月了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "可露希爾，可露希爾！你要的“雷神挑釁者熔岩貓魔鬼高性能作業平台”的優化方案我做好了，給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "辛苦梅爾。接下來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "接下來的話，我想請假一個月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哇！工作狂居然也會請假？是身體太累了？或者說......你是在暗示加薪對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "當然不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "目前萊茵生命和羅德島的工作委託都結束了，日程表現在是清空的狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "所以想要趁機升級一下咪波。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你不是一直在抽空升級咪波嘛，為什麼突然要專門申請一段時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "這幾個月來，服役的咪波又報廢了三隻，還有幾隻待維修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "最初代的咪波......只剩下一隻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚，可憐的咪波。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "雖然咪波的作業效率已經得到了提升，但遇到特別複雜的環境，或者執行精密度要求比較高的任務時，回收率還是無法保證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "如果咪波能達到人工智慧的高度，它們就可以在完成任務的同時保護好自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那我也來幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "還是不了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "為什麼，我們不是剛一起幫艾沃娜成功改造了“正義騎士號”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "那是依託PRTS進行的客製化，連可露希爾都沒有完全掌握小車們的代碼與運算邏輯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我不希望對咪波進行客製化，從萊茵生命到羅德島，它們的所有改造都是我自己做的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "有問題我會請教可露希爾的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "之前就已經給咪波搭載了學習裝置，但肯定算不上真正的“智慧”，我需要重新做起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我嘗試直接對原先的咪波核心進行優化，從而完善它的自律邏輯。哎，效果並不太理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "所以我重寫了咪波核心底層的代碼......花了很多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "原計劃咪波SUPER的原型機應該是五隻，可以進行對照實驗，但最終才完成了一隻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "但是！這隻咪波SUPER，將是前所未有的！它可以應用於更多樣更複雜的場景，爆破、勘探、測繪、偵查、作戰以及日常生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "更重要的是，它可以完全脫離我的操控，獨立完成各種精密作業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "它將是全泰拉最厲害的智慧機械......個頭還小，量產起來也很方便，比可露希爾客製化的小車厲害多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "到時候它們將組成一支真正的咪波大軍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "咪波SUPER身上這是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "銘牌啊，每一隻咪波都有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "問題是，它身上為什麼會有這麼多塊！我看一下，C00-1、B03-4、B12、G70......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "是以前那些無法再服役，或者徹底報廢的咪波的銘牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我知道，但那些你不都鑲進“大咪波碑”裡了嗎？你把它們都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "所以咪波SUPER是......“帶著兄弟們的希望”，這樣的意思嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不過，剛剛梅爾並沒有關閉自己對咪波核心的控制權限吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這樣不能算達到了“智慧”哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "過兩天會進行應用試驗的下一階段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那我到時候再過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "對了梅爾，下次試驗之前，記得調整下咪波SUPER爆破程式的參數哦，這裡可是羅德島本艦，萬一咪波SUPER......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我得趕緊把今天的資料記錄進試驗日誌裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "梅爾，你有沒有在聽我說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "知道了知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "對了咪波SUPER，你改的門禁新密碼是多少啊，我試一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咦，奇怪，好像不對欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波核心控制權限已關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER，接下來請對指定區域的建築進行檢測及隱患排除作業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "當然了，這裡可是羅德島本艦，你要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "唉呀，你已經是智能咪波了，這點判斷能力肯定是有的哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "接下來只需要等待咪波SUPER完成任務回來就行啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "啊，新的工作委託，已經堆了這麼多......看來這次確實耽擱了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我看看——唔，為部分幹員宿舍加裝牆體投影、訓練場武器系統的調整升級、本艦無人機群和充能裝置的聯動方案......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "呀，工作室裡也亂糟糟的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "趁這個時間，收拾下操作台吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "咪波——SUPER。建築檢測。隱患排除。建築檢測。隱患排除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "共檢測出八處不合理構造，計算量——隱患均已排除，方式為——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "還剩下最後一處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“魯特拉工作室”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "操作台這下看著整潔多啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "全景掃描。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "調取比對資料——啟用分析系統。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "結果判定——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "該空間建築面積大於常規，生活或工作用途不明，存在危險器械——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "警告，隱患排除，請撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "接下來，把這幾套熱能感應裝置修好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "警告，隱患排除，請撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "原料又不太夠了，看來明天得向採購部提交一批加購訂單才行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "隱患排除方式為——隱患排除方式為——為——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "爆破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "好像有什麼動靜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梅爾的反應並不算慢。當然，如果她沒戴著耳機的話，還能更快一些。真是個壞習慣。\n咪波SUPER的爆破程式已經啟動。\n延展式機械臂讓梅爾及時按下了防衝擊系統的啟動按鈕，這讓咪波SUPER的定向爆破產生了偏差。\n魯特拉工作室的主要區域並未受到影響，但門口承裝工程材料的伸出式平台被擊毀了。\n梅爾看著咪波SUPER被埋在了自己爆破炸出的廢墟裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗚哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "啊，這些儀器怎麼這麼重！幸虧機械臂的充能裝置沒有受影響，不然都挪不開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "梅爾，怎麼回事，好遠就聽見你工作室的動靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "咪波SUPER......好像損毀得很嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這些，都是它幹的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "也不能全怪它......早就跟你說不要將宿舍用作工作室，更不要擴建。我看看承重結構有沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "對了，可露希爾，咪波SUPER不會在巡視的其他地方也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我剛從那邊過來，還好還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "（幸虧留了個心眼，提前在附近加裝了局域防衝擊裝置，呼——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "梅爾，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我幫你一起收拾吧。你看，都亂成這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "和那時候好像啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "唔，工作室這個亂糟糟的樣子，和那時候好像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗚嗚你別嚇我啊，怎麼開始胡言亂語了呢，我不記得你是那種動不動就回憶的人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我是說最開始做咪波的時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "梅爾的工作室怎麼又出問題了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是本月第三回了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要嘛是計時儀器突然停止運作，要嘛是冷凝系統故障，這回是......椅子自己彈起來把操作台撞翻了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "總之是些不大不小的故障，讓她不得不暫離項目崗位，趕回自己的工作室......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "都已經同意她成立一人工作室了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她說是巧合，你就當是巧合吧。這點小心思，連心機都算不上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "能夠進入萊茵生命，我超級興奮。\n不僅是哥倫比亞，放在整個泰拉，那也是研究者眼中的聖地。有設備有項目有厲害的前輩福利待遇還好！\n科學能決定泰拉的未來，是我們的共識。但對於科學，萊茵生命內部，尤其是各個主任之間，各有各的理解，各有各的追求，偏執得很。\n氛圍變得很奇怪，明明都是很厲害的研究者，但聚在一起效率卻莫名地低。就像一支全明星組成的球隊，總是打不贏比賽。\n我在的工程科，主要為其他科室提供技術支援。上個月由能量科牽頭的項目，籌備到一半，由於總轄反對，這個月就可能中止或取消。\n同樣，出於“某些”考慮，防衛科也能叫停正在進行的項目。\n在萊茵生命的時候，總發生類似的事情。小職員們只能把設備裝了拆，拆了裝，調試又調試。\n還不如自己搞點研究呢，我是這樣想的。\n所以我研究出了個搗蛋鬼鬧鐘。它會在設定好的時段裡，在工作室搞點小破壞，雖然不嚴重但又必須要我馬上趕回來處理的那種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "這就是咪波的雛形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "後來我把它們改造成了更實用的操縱機械。“咪波”也是加上開機提示音時取的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "呃，所以梅爾每次都開開心心地回來收拾亂糟糟的房間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "是呀哈哈。那段時間，雖說在總部參與的項目並沒有取得什麼實質性的進展，但我自己研發了不少小東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "後來給赫默幫忙的時候，有些裝置得到她的推薦，在萊茵生命一直應用至今呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "咪波是梅爾最喜歡的作品吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗯啊，我一直希望它們成為最厲害的智慧機械。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "畢竟從萊茵生命到羅德島，這些傢伙一直都陪著我，它們是大功臣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "只是因為報廢回收、版本升級......初代服役的咪波只剩下一隻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "咪波SUPER......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "就是在僅剩的這隻初代機的基礎上完成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "想讓機械達到人工智慧的高度，哪有那麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不要失落啊梅爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "梅爾梅爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "怎麼啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "從智慧的角度來說，咪波SUPER雖然沒有成功，但是也不算完全失敗哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "你不用安慰我啦，可露希爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你看這些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "——咪波的銘牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "是啊。咪波SUPER的肢體組件都已經被重物壓得碎裂變形了，它身上的銘牌雖然全部掉落......可是卻完好無損欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "銘牌的材質總不會有咪波組件本身堅固吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗚哇！你是說，它在受到衝擊前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "可能只是巧合，也可能，是“本能”啊什麼的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波SUPER......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波SUPER",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "語音模組嚴重損毀，它已經沒辦法回答什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "幹得漂亮！你沒看見我請假走的時候那些傢伙的表情哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "不過下次得把你放得遠一些才行，弄倒椅子就行了，破壞了實驗器材總歸還是要花時間修復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我是不是該給你取個名字啊......這樣吧，待會給你隨機設置個開機提示音，提示音什麼樣你就叫什麼名字！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波，過來，我要重新設定下你爆破程式的參數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波，幫我調整一下機械臂的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波，幫我把那個熱能裝置搬過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "咪波......欸，你怎麼知道我要用這個校準儀哈哈，謝謝啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗚哇，咪波你要幹什麼！別拽我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "只是先幹一會活，不會忘記吃飯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咪波",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_545_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "好我知道了，我吃，現在就吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "所以說，雖然比小車們差了一些，但咪波SUPER還是進步了很多的。梅爾不要放棄哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "那可以再給我批兩個月的假期嗎？！可露希爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "我想趁熱打鐵，在咪波SUPER的基礎上進行第二次智慧升級！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不可以！拉著我撒嬌也不可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你已經耽誤了三個月，工程部那邊有不少工作委託需要處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "還有關於咪波SUPER此次試驗的全過程，尤其是意外事故部分，需要提交詳實的書面報告才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "最重要的，魯特拉工作室的維修費用，需要梅爾自己出！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_242_otter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "《咪波SUPER試驗日誌09》\n本次咪波升級失敗。\n......\n但不管怎樣，咪波依然還在梅爾身邊，他們還擁有無限可能。\n梅爾相信咪波。\n梅爾相信梅爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
